WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.625 --> 00:00:04.838
♪ All, all the joys under the sun wrapped into one ♪ 

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:09.009
♪ You're all, all that I need ♪ 

00:00:11.761 --> 00:00:16.725
(dramatic music)

00:00:20.937 --> 00:00:22.355
(audience cheering)

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:23.148
Action!

00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:26.860
CODA the film sparked the concept of this music video

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:29.195
where we can show the world how we as

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:31.489
deaf people experience music.

00:00:31.489 --> 00:00:32.907
♪ You'll be there to push me up the hill ♪

00:00:32.907 --> 00:00:38.163
♪ There's no, no looking back for us ♪

00:00:38.163 --> 00:00:42.709
♪ We got love, sure enough that's enough ♪

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:47.630
♪ You're all, all that I need ♪

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:49.507
♪ to get by ♪

00:00:49.507 --> 00:00:53.094
Music is so much more than sound.

00:00:53.762 --> 00:00:54.679
It's feeling.

00:00:56.347 --> 00:00:57.265
I love that smile.

00:01:01.352 --> 00:01:07.442
The lyrical meaning of this song comes to life as a visual story.

00:01:07.442 --> 00:01:10.820
From the rhythmic camera movements to dance-like blocking

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:16.367
that bring out the tone and mood of the music.

00:01:16.367 --> 00:01:21.539
♪ You're all, all the joys under the sun wrapped into one ♪

00:01:21.539 --> 00:01:26.544
♪ You're all, all that I need ♪

00:01:26.544 --> 00:01:29.339
We have the opportunity to show added layers

00:01:29.339 --> 00:01:32.050
that come from our specific experiences.

00:01:33.176 --> 00:01:36.554
♪ All that I need ♪

00:01:38.515 --> 00:01:42.060
♪ to get by ♪

